# Examples

Some examples of using gr-linalg for hypothetical applicaitons that hopefully are a good reference.

## Gnu Radio Companion

Here are a few examples focused on Gnu Radio Companion.

### Spacial Beam Former

This is a simple example using using gr-linalg to perform basic beam forming of 8 spacial channels.

### Code Devision Multiple Access

Basic CDMA example

### Simple Kalman Filter

This is a simple example of a Kalman filter of a particle in 2D with first and second dirivatives.

